# =============================================================================
# Semgrep ignore patterns for Taskdeck
# Excludes generated code, test fixtures, and vendored dependencies.
# =============================================================================

# Build output and artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/coverage/
**/artifacts/

# Generated / scaffolded files
**/Migrations/
**/wwwroot/

# Test fixtures and mock data (not production code)
**/tests/**/Fixtures/
**/tests/**/TestData/
**/__snapshots__/

# Documentation
docs/
*.md

# Config and lock files
**/package-lock.json
**/packages.lock.json
**/*.csproj
**/*.sln

# Scripts (CI helpers, not production code)
scripts/

# Deploy configuration
deploy/

# IDE and tooling
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
